<p><a href="http://www.dictionary.com/e/itch-vs-scratch/">Itch vs. Scratch</a>. These are not the same, yet you used them interchangibly throughout.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Examples</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
